      "message": "\u003e Thanks - I had a look at those, I think it can work but is perhaps a little heavy for our needs? Before going ahead, wanted to check if you had a preference for re-using eg DECLARE_EXTENSION_COMMAND, or whether implementing a perhaps lighter weight but similar thing just for this use case is worth considering?\n\nYes, I meant a lighter weight but similar thing. just pointed to solutions t similar cases already accepted into cr50.\ndirectly reusing DECLARE_EXTENSION_COMMAND doesn\u0027t make sense here, since we don\u0027t want to mix handlers for extension commands and for virtual NVRAM spaces in the same table.",
